WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.060 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 11]

01:43.670 --> 01:44.380
Don't kill me!

01:45.110 --> 01:45.700
Don't kill me!

01:46.350 --> 01:47.410
Senior, save me!

01:49.000 --> 01:49.780
This is quite a predicament.

01:49.820 --> 01:51.220
Senior!

01:51.810 --> 01:52.740
Help won't come.

02:03.640 --> 02:04.980
Another one with a death wish?

02:05.440 --> 02:06.850
So, how do you two want to die?

03:44.870 --> 03:45.690
I'll give you a hand!

04:10.560 --> 04:11.610
What kind of artifact is that?

04:12.910 --> 04:14.060
Want a duel with artifacts?

04:14.750 --> 04:16.260
I've never lost one!

04:23.710 --> 04:24.780
Die now!

04:30.310 --> 04:30.980
Who's attacking?

04:31.150 --> 04:31.610
Where are they?

04:33.120 --> 04:33.940
Let me grab the loot first.

04:41.030 --> 04:41.450
It's Feng Yue!

04:41.680 --> 04:43.060
That lunatic from Skyfort Castle!

04:48.280 --> 04:49.660
Since you know who I am,

04:50.240 --> 04:51.290
why aren't you running yet?

05:02.630 --> 05:03.220
Kid,

05:03.590 --> 05:04.500
I gave you a chance.

05:04.870 --> 05:05.570
Why didn't you run?

05:06.000 --> 05:07.260
Turning my back on the enemy means death.

05:08.120 --> 05:08.940
If I ran,

05:09.430 --> 05:10.450
I'd be just like her.

05:13.310 --> 05:15.290
Well, you're a fun one for once.

05:17.000 --> 05:18.980
Then let me have some fun with you!

07:35.630 --> 07:37.780
You really brought out that crappy Primordial Pearl?

07:41.600 --> 07:42.930
You think that's all I've got?

07:43.840 --> 07:44.700
Try this one.

07:44.880 --> 07:45.540
See how it feels!

08:19.040 --> 08:20.410
Not even ashes will remain.

08:21.510 --> 08:23.170
Shame about that yellow umbrella though.

08:42.680 --> 08:43.460
What's this?

08:46.800 --> 08:47.250
Forget it.

08:47.800 --> 08:48.460
I'll take it for now

08:48.920 --> 08:49.730
and study it later.

08:52.630 --> 08:53.810
The boots are still intact!

08:54.800 --> 08:55.460
They must be

08:55.920 --> 08:56.700
something valuable.

09:06.720 --> 09:07.660
Better not stick around!

09:25.830 --> 09:26.900
Looks like Violet Monkey Blossoms!

09:27.070 --> 09:27.610
They really are!

09:31.270 --> 09:32.410
There's another one over there!

09:35.560 --> 09:36.780
Hey, seniors, look!

09:36.800 --> 09:37.850
Violet Monkey Blossoms, right here!

09:54.480 --> 09:55.410
Saying hi to us?

09:55.630 --> 09:56.700
Like we're old pals.

10:23.960 --> 10:25.650
This remote spot really was the right call.

10:27.270 --> 10:28.940
The spirit herbs here may be young,

10:29.360 --> 10:30.420
but no one's competing for them.

10:53.000 --> 10:53.460
See?

10:54.030 --> 10:55.220
It's aged enough now!

11:01.870 --> 11:02.530
When I get back,

11:02.790 --> 11:03.610
I'll hand in a few

11:04.150 --> 11:04.890
and keep the rest

11:05.240 --> 11:05.940
for myself.

11:06.910 --> 11:07.490
Still,

11:08.120 --> 11:09.460
two days have flown by already.

11:11.080 --> 11:12.460
Time to find those three herbs.

11:29.910 --> 11:30.610
Violet Monkey Blossoms!

11:56.960 --> 11:57.700
Han Li?

12:00.910 --> 12:01.650
Senior Chen?

12:05.360 --> 12:05.940
You're hurt?

12:07.750 --> 12:09.250
Why do you have the Qingjiao Banner?

12:10.080 --> 12:11.420
That belongs to Lu Mingyuan!

12:11.960 --> 12:12.530
Oh no...

12:13.080 --> 12:13.940
She saw it.

12:14.270 --> 12:15.180
It's a misunderstanding, Senior.

12:15.630 --> 12:16.370
My artifact

12:16.630 --> 12:17.300
just looks a lot like

12:17.440 --> 12:18.130
the Qingjiao Banner.

12:18.960 --> 12:19.530
A misunderstanding?

12:20.600 --> 12:21.340
No way.

12:22.390 --> 12:23.770
You saved me that day, right?

12:25.000 --> 12:26.180
But you took my Foundation Pill,

12:26.600 --> 12:27.980
so now you don't dare admit it, right?

12:29.910 --> 12:30.940
You're poisoned now.

12:31.440 --> 12:33.220
You may start seeing weird visions.

12:34.600 --> 12:35.700
I have an antidote.

12:37.080 --> 12:38.100
Take it quickly.

12:38.670 --> 12:39.370
Or else...

12:39.840 --> 12:41.060
you may not make it out of the Trial Ground.

12:48.080 --> 12:48.940
Once you're cured,

12:49.390 --> 12:50.700
if you still have questions,

12:51.200 --> 12:51.940
I promise

12:52.390 --> 12:53.300
I'll answer them all.

13:21.150 --> 13:21.850
This pill

13:22.000 --> 13:23.180
really does work.

13:24.750 --> 13:26.100
So are you going to tell me now?

13:26.840 --> 13:27.890
Even if you don't,

13:28.750 --> 13:29.730
I already know.

13:32.120 --> 13:32.770
I...

13:33.960 --> 13:35.180
know too...

13:40.750 --> 13:41.490
I'm sorry.

13:42.670 --> 13:43.460
This Oblivion Pill

13:43.790 --> 13:45.010
will help you get some real rest.

13:46.390 --> 13:47.580
I'll find you a safe spot.

13:51.790 --> 13:53.460
[Bloody Trial Ground, Day 3]
That's a huge piece of Jade Marrow Mushroom.

13:53.880 --> 13:54.620
No way it won't draw

13:54.880 --> 13:55.500
much attention!

13:56.830 --> 13:57.620
Keep your voice down.

13:58.430 --> 13:59.580
Don't let anyone hear us.

14:05.550 --> 14:07.380
These two are really going all in,

14:07.910 --> 14:09.810
even using Jade Marrow Mushroom as bait.

14:12.520 --> 14:13.500
I'm tired. I'll rest for a bit.

14:13.600 --> 14:14.290
Keep watch, will you?

14:15.600 --> 14:16.100
Don't worry.

14:31.190 --> 14:31.620
Senior!

14:32.240 --> 14:32.740
What is wrong?

14:33.000 --> 14:33.340
The...

14:33.550 --> 14:34.140
The Mushroom!

14:37.070 --> 14:37.890
Where's my Mushroom?

14:38.360 --> 14:39.140
It's gone in a blink!

14:39.480 --> 14:40.260
Who took it?

14:41.670 --> 14:42.010
After them!

14:50.000 --> 14:50.690
Li!

14:52.400 --> 14:52.890
Who's there?

14:53.240 --> 14:53.810
Who's hiding over there?

15:01.830 --> 15:03.050
I saw him jump in there!

15:03.600 --> 15:04.010
Yu!

15:05.520 --> 15:06.050
Qi!

15:07.190 --> 15:07.580
Where is he?

15:08.430 --> 15:09.650
I saw him run this way!

15:10.400 --> 15:11.340
How'd he just vanish?

15:14.160 --> 15:14.810
Weird...

15:15.640 --> 15:16.810
Where could he have gone?

15:18.160 --> 15:18.690
There's a path that way.

15:19.120 --> 15:20.140
Come on, let's check it out.

15:20.430 --> 15:20.810
Yeah.

15:31.400 --> 15:32.580
This high-grade stealth artifact

15:32.790 --> 15:33.290
is amazing.

15:34.310 --> 15:34.740
Miss Han,

15:35.030 --> 15:35.410
thank you.

15:36.670 --> 15:37.580
What are you doing here?

15:39.400 --> 15:40.580
It's my fault. I was useless.

15:40.790 --> 15:42.140
Right after I entered the Trial Ground,

15:42.480 --> 15:43.550
my mystic pouch and map

15:43.550 --> 15:44.500
got stolen.

15:46.510 --> 15:47.740
I didn't know what to do,

15:48.160 --> 15:49.340
so I just found a place

15:49.360 --> 15:50.260
to hide for now.

15:55.710 --> 15:56.580
This pill

15:56.880 --> 15:58.140
should help restore your strength.

15:58.430 --> 15:59.290
Here, take it.

16:00.480 --> 16:01.460
Thank you, Li.

16:03.280 --> 16:04.290
Honestly,

16:04.710 --> 16:05.980
when I first got here,

16:06.070 --> 16:07.010
I was scared out of my mind.

16:08.310 --> 16:10.100
But if I can't find Solarflame Blossom,

16:10.640 --> 16:11.890
my brother's illness...

16:15.600 --> 16:17.460
I really don't know what else to do.

16:18.600 --> 16:19.690
Aren't those two

16:20.030 --> 16:20.980
your sect mates?

16:21.710 --> 16:22.050
No,

16:22.310 --> 16:23.220
I don't know them.

16:25.280 --> 16:26.220
You don't?

16:28.360 --> 16:29.530
Didn't you all come in together?

16:30.190 --> 16:31.620
I never saw them

16:31.950 --> 16:33.260
when I was at Spirit Beast Mountain.

16:38.950 --> 16:39.530
Li,

16:40.000 --> 16:41.050
don't worry about me.

16:41.670 --> 16:43.170
With this stealth artifact,

16:43.280 --> 16:44.460
I can definitely make it to the fifth day.

16:45.790 --> 16:47.340
Go find what you came here for.

16:47.640 --> 16:48.620
There's not much time.

17:02.910 --> 17:03.890
You're looking for Solarflame Blossom?

17:05.950 --> 17:06.650
Yeah.

17:07.120 --> 17:08.010
That is

17:08.160 --> 17:09.410
the whole reason I came here.

17:10.120 --> 17:11.010
I'll take you.

17:13.030 --> 17:13.740
That's great!

17:14.600 --> 17:15.380
Thanks, Li!

17:16.030 --> 17:16.500
Don't mention it.

17:16.910 --> 17:17.580
It's on my way anyway.

17:49.070 --> 17:50.770
Where can we find Solarflame Blossom?

17:51.310 --> 17:52.100
It's not marked

17:52.310 --> 17:53.860
on my map at all.

17:54.310 --> 17:55.170
But they say

17:55.360 --> 17:56.770
most spirit herbs in the Trial Ground

17:57.070 --> 17:58.860
can be found near the central ring of mountains.

17:59.240 --> 17:59.980
It shouldn't be a problem.

18:14.480 --> 18:15.170
Something's off with that sound.

18:15.280 --> 18:16.010
Cover your ears!

18:21.160 --> 18:21.740
Run!

18:24.360 --> 18:25.010
Jump!

18:46.750 --> 18:47.490
Li,

18:47.880 --> 18:49.360
that flying python looks strange.

18:49.600 --> 18:50.970
It doesn't seem like a spirit beast here.

18:51.270 --> 18:51.820
You're right.

18:52.230 --> 18:53.170
That whistle earlier

18:53.360 --> 18:54.380
must've come from its master.

18:55.270 --> 18:56.380
He's hiding somewhere.

18:57.990 --> 18:59.100
As far as I know,

18:59.360 --> 19:00.450
in all of Spirit Beast Mountain,

19:00.600 --> 19:02.340
only one senior raises that kind of beast.

19:02.640 --> 19:03.450
His name's Zhong Wu.

19:04.600 --> 19:05.300
Zhong Wu?

19:06.670 --> 19:07.650
If he finds out

19:07.800 --> 19:09.100
we killed his flying python,

19:09.230 --> 19:10.490
he won't let us off easy.

19:11.400 --> 19:12.340
Maybe...

19:13.560 --> 19:14.300
we should...

19:14.560 --> 19:15.820
just go around instead?

19:17.880 --> 19:18.890
We're short on time.

19:27.710 --> 19:29.210
You two've got some guts.

19:30.600 --> 19:31.650
You killed my spirit python

19:32.510 --> 19:34.210
and still dared to show up here?

19:35.950 --> 19:36.690
Senior Zhong,

19:37.470 --> 19:38.650
please let us pass.

19:38.950 --> 19:40.210
We won't take a single herb from here.

19:40.360 --> 19:41.170
It's all yours!

19:42.270 --> 19:43.650
Spare me the sweet talk.

19:44.320 --> 19:45.170
If you've got guts, come here.

19:45.800 --> 19:47.020
Let's have a little duel.

19:52.950 --> 19:53.580
Wait a second!

19:56.270 --> 19:57.250
Are those shoes...

19:57.880 --> 19:58.730
Cloud-Riding Boots?

20:05.190 --> 20:05.780
Yeah.

20:06.470 --> 20:07.580
Aren't those Feng Yue's?

20:08.720 --> 20:10.490
Did he lose his mind and give them to you?

20:11.750 --> 20:12.890
What's he wearing now then?

20:14.750 --> 20:15.650
You know him,

20:15.840 --> 20:17.140
so you should know

20:17.560 --> 20:18.450
he'll never give them away.

20:20.080 --> 20:22.060
So you're saying you killed that lunatic Feng Yue

20:24.270 --> 20:25.780
and stole his boots?

20:26.990 --> 20:27.730
What do you think?

20:31.840 --> 20:33.410
That belt on you looks nice too.

20:34.270 --> 20:34.860
Hey, hold on!

20:34.880 --> 20:35.620
I'm not done talking yet!

20:35.670 --> 20:36.580
Step back!

20:36.640 --> 20:37.210
Back off!

20:37.270 --> 20:38.380
I said I'm not done!

20:40.470 --> 20:42.620
I actually think my junior has a point.

20:43.600 --> 20:45.020
It's fate we crossed paths.

20:46.360 --> 20:47.580
Who knows? Maybe later,

20:48.160 --> 20:49.170
we'll need each other.

20:50.950 --> 20:51.620
So what are you offering?

20:52.560 --> 20:53.250
A map.

20:54.160 --> 20:56.060
Each sect's map of the Bloody Trial Ground

20:56.510 --> 20:57.620
is unique.

20:57.910 --> 20:59.250
I happen to have a version

20:59.430 --> 21:00.250
from Spirit Beast Mountain.

21:01.160 --> 21:02.170
You can consider

21:02.400 --> 21:04.020
trading me Yellow Maple Valley's.

21:04.840 --> 21:05.450
Not a bad deal, right?

21:06.670 --> 21:07.890
Spirit Beast Mountain's map?

21:12.040 --> 21:13.100
Miss Han already has one.

21:13.750 --> 21:14.450
We don't need to see yours.

21:18.400 --> 21:19.380
You do?

21:24.430 --> 21:25.210
I forgot about that.

21:30.120 --> 21:30.890
Then how about one

21:31.080 --> 21:31.890
from the Saber-Shearing Sect?

21:33.560 --> 21:34.930
How do I know it's real?

21:35.710 --> 21:36.210
No deal.

21:36.880 --> 21:38.210
How can I scam you?

21:38.510 --> 21:39.060
Tell you what,

21:39.120 --> 21:39.780
I'll throw in

21:39.910 --> 21:40.620
Skyfort Castle's too.

21:40.880 --> 21:41.860
Two for one.

21:41.950 --> 21:43.250
There's no way

21:43.400 --> 21:45.450
I can make so many different ones.

21:46.120 --> 21:46.820
Am I right?

21:49.600 --> 21:50.170
Deal?

21:53.320 --> 21:53.730
Okay then.

21:53.910 --> 21:54.620
I'll count to three,

21:55.320 --> 21:56.450
and we exchange at the same time.

21:57.360 --> 21:57.890
Three,

21:58.270 --> 21:58.650
two,

21:59.120 --> 21:59.450
one!

22:07.950 --> 22:09.210
We agreed to do it together!

22:09.270 --> 22:10.250
What kind of deal is this?

22:35.880 --> 22:36.890
He got away again!

22:37.080 --> 22:37.690
Yu,

22:38.160 --> 22:39.490
where do you think he could've gone?

22:40.270 --> 22:40.970
Who knows.

22:41.400 --> 22:42.730
That kid sure runs fast.

22:54.270 --> 22:54.890
Oh, it's you.

22:55.320 --> 22:56.140
You scared us!

22:57.040 --> 22:57.580
So,

22:58.470 --> 22:59.620
where's my Blood Spirit Flower?

23:12.910 --> 23:14.100
We did what you asked.

23:14.470 --> 23:15.210
Now what else do you want?

23:17.670 --> 23:18.860
Besides the flower,

23:19.160 --> 23:20.780
we're also supposed to take out

23:20.950 --> 23:22.300
elite disciples from the Seven Sects.

23:23.430 --> 23:24.730
Did you forget about that?

23:26.560 --> 23:27.250
The two of us

23:27.360 --> 23:28.930
have already killed plenty of them.

23:29.800 --> 23:30.890
What about you?

23:33.800 --> 23:34.780
On the surface,

23:34.950 --> 23:36.300
I'm still part of Spirit Beast Mountain.

23:36.510 --> 23:37.780
It's hard for me to make a move directly.

23:38.160 --> 23:39.210
That's why I need you two!

23:41.320 --> 23:42.060
Just now,

23:42.270 --> 23:43.620
I ran into a guy and a girl.

23:43.990 --> 23:45.060
The girl's from Spirit Beast Mountain.

23:45.800 --> 23:47.380
The guy's from Yellow Maple Valley.

23:48.360 --> 23:50.020
I saw them both gathering

23:50.270 --> 23:51.820
quite a few spirit herbs.

23:53.560 --> 23:54.540
Now tell me,

23:56.160 --> 23:57.490
you two got any ideas?

24:00.360 --> 24:01.250
Need me to spell it out?

24:02.560 --> 24:03.450
Why don't you

24:03.510 --> 24:04.210
go take them out,

24:05.640 --> 24:06.340
grab their herbs,

24:08.640 --> 24:09.450
then we each get a cut.

24:11.750 --> 24:12.410
You get it now?

24:13.750 --> 24:14.690
What does he look like?

24:16.880 --> 24:17.540
Tall and skinny,

24:18.190 --> 24:19.170
pretty plain-looking.

24:20.470 --> 24:21.970
Plain-looking?

24:26.910 --> 24:27.970
Where are they now?

24:29.320 --> 24:30.250
That girl

24:30.430 --> 24:31.730
was looking for medicine for her brother.

24:32.360 --> 24:33.650
So they're probably headed

24:33.910 --> 24:34.930
to the Solarflame Cave

24:35.270 --> 24:36.540
to hunt for spirit herbs.

24:37.360 --> 24:39.410
Ambush them before they get there.

24:40.120 --> 24:41.490
Their cultivation is weak,

24:41.990 --> 24:43.210
weaker than you think!

24:43.880 --> 24:45.100
That's all from me.

25:04.360 --> 25:05.100
Everyone,

25:06.190 --> 25:08.410
disciples are dying unusually fast.

25:09.430 --> 25:11.060
Did none of you notice?

25:12.990 --> 25:15.380
Now that the Trial Ground opens once every 60 years,

25:16.160 --> 25:19.020
they'll fight tooth and nail for herbs.

25:19.470 --> 25:20.820
The bloodshed this time

25:21.160 --> 25:23.210
will be worse than ever.

25:24.040 --> 25:25.140
Elder Han,

25:26.270 --> 25:28.410
didn't we all go through this back in the day?

25:29.040 --> 25:30.140
Relax, everyone!

25:30.400 --> 25:31.020
They'll be fine!

25:41.300 --> 25:43.980
[Bloody Trial Ground, Day 4]

25:43.990 --> 25:44.970
It's so dark.

25:46.040 --> 25:47.060
I can't see a thing.

25:48.080 --> 25:48.730
In a place like this,

25:49.270 --> 25:50.860
if we don't follow the stars and markings,

25:51.360 --> 25:52.210
we're bound to get lost.

25:53.510 --> 25:54.490
What do we do now?

26:04.750 --> 26:05.690
It's the Solunar Purification Pearl!

26:06.320 --> 26:07.250
Three days have passed.

26:07.750 --> 26:08.730
That Pearl

26:08.950 --> 26:09.540
was made specifically

26:09.560 --> 26:11.020
to cut through the Trial Ground's mists.

26:12.080 --> 26:12.780
With it,

26:12.880 --> 26:14.170
we won't lose our way!

26:25.160 --> 26:25.650
Found it!

26:26.430 --> 26:27.250
That way!

26:31.040 --> 26:31.780
Solarflame Blossoms!

26:31.990 --> 26:33.140
A whole field of them!

26:40.640 --> 26:41.100
Run!

26:49.040 --> 26:50.300
Nowhere left to run, huh?

27:03.430 --> 27:04.860
You want Solarflame Blossoms?

27:05.320 --> 27:07.060
I won't let you have them!

27:08.270 --> 27:08.970
No!

27:10.510 --> 27:11.730
Solarflame Blossoms...

27:12.950 --> 27:13.930
Solarflame Blossoms...

27:15.120 --> 27:17.210
Not a single flower left...

27:20.470 --> 27:22.100
They fought way too viciously.

27:22.400 --> 27:23.300
And their techniques

27:23.750 --> 27:24.860
aren't from the Seven Sects at all.

27:25.950 --> 27:27.380
They're not from Spirit Beast Mountain.

27:28.270 --> 27:29.380
Then who are they?

27:43.470 --> 27:44.340
Stop crying.

27:46.470 --> 27:47.170
There's still one left.

27:51.320 --> 27:51.930
Thank you!

27:52.430 --> 27:52.860
Li,

27:53.190 --> 27:54.340
I saved this flatbread for you.

27:54.430 --> 27:55.210
Take it!

28:00.640 --> 28:01.300
It's dangerous here.

28:01.800 --> 28:02.300
Let's go.

28:04.430 --> 28:05.300
Li,

28:05.800 --> 28:07.100
how can I ever thank you?

28:07.950 --> 28:08.780
Once we're out of here,

28:09.160 --> 28:10.300
make me a few flatbreads!

28:11.710 --> 28:12.860
Flatbreads?

28:15.980 --> 28:18.740
[Bloody Trial Ground, Day 5]

28:33.270 --> 28:33.730
We're almost there.

28:33.950 --> 28:34.450
Let's move.

28:41.120 --> 28:43.450
I've gathered the Violet Monkey Blossom and Jade Marrow Mushroom.

28:44.040 --> 28:45.060
Just need the Celestial Essence Fruit now.

28:48.160 --> 28:49.210
According to the map,

28:49.510 --> 28:50.580
it should be right around here.

28:51.040 --> 28:51.970
But I don't see it anywhere.

28:53.120 --> 28:55.410
Maybe someone else have picked it?

28:56.470 --> 28:57.450
Time's running out.

28:57.950 --> 28:58.970
Let me check this place

28:59.230 --> 29:00.580
for any unripe sprouts.

29:12.880 --> 29:14.300
Even spirit sense can't get through it!

29:23.880 --> 29:24.580
I'll take a gamble.

29:34.560 --> 29:36.540
This should be the stone temple mentioned in the records.

29:36.880 --> 29:38.890
This place actually blocks spirit sense.

29:44.120 --> 29:45.100
Everyone, stay alert.

29:45.670 --> 29:47.690
We'll give it our all, Grandmaster!

29:49.670 --> 29:50.820
Yu, Qing,

29:51.160 --> 29:52.100
you two stay behind

29:52.190 --> 29:53.340
and keep searching for the Blood Spirit Flower.

29:53.880 --> 29:55.780
This concerns Yan Ruyan's life

29:55.910 --> 29:57.450
and our relationship with the Yan Clan Stronghold.

29:57.880 --> 29:58.820
We must not take it lightly.

29:59.320 --> 30:00.300
Yes, Grandmaster!

30:01.160 --> 30:01.780
All others,

30:01.910 --> 30:02.730
stick close to me!

30:15.840 --> 30:16.650
It's so strange.

30:17.360 --> 30:18.650
I can't even scan this place with spirit sense.

30:19.990 --> 30:21.020
There's only one path

30:21.430 --> 30:22.380
all the way through.

30:23.640 --> 30:25.020
If I'm surrounded here,

30:25.470 --> 30:26.580
I'll have no way to escape.

30:28.710 --> 30:29.250
No,

30:29.880 --> 30:30.890
I can't take that risk.

30:31.710 --> 30:33.020
I'll search elsewhere.

30:35.120 --> 30:35.540
No!

30:35.840 --> 30:36.380
Someone's here!

30:40.750 --> 30:41.540
It's a dead end!

31:01.160 --> 31:01.730
What is this?

31:06.560 --> 31:07.210
Grandmaster,

31:07.510 --> 31:08.890
they say the Blackscale Python here

31:08.990 --> 31:09.820
is a Tier 1 demon beast.

31:10.230 --> 31:11.340
Is this place even safe?

31:12.560 --> 31:13.490
Stay calm.

31:13.710 --> 31:14.890
Stick to the plan.

31:15.160 --> 31:15.860
Leave everything to me.

31:16.990 --> 31:17.860
Grandmaster?

31:18.750 --> 31:20.340
A Core Formation cultivator's here?

31:22.320 --> 31:23.060
It's her.

31:30.950 --> 31:32.140
It really is here!

31:34.360 --> 31:35.170
All of you, listen up!

31:35.560 --> 31:36.170
From this moment on,

31:36.320 --> 31:37.100
lock down the area.

31:37.360 --> 31:38.140
Guard all sides.

31:38.510 --> 31:39.140
Form the array!

31:39.670 --> 31:40.860
Yes, Grandmaster!

31:48.880 --> 31:49.890
There really is a Celestial Essence Fruit!

31:50.710 --> 31:51.860
I have to find a way to get it.

33:24.670 --> 33:25.730
Is that the Blackscale Python?

33:26.880 --> 33:28.410
It doesn't quite match the illustrations.

34:06.800 --> 34:08.020
What a fierce fight!

34:08.510 --> 34:09.250
Tough luck

34:09.400 --> 34:10.450
running into me!

34:13.400 --> 34:14.730
I don't care which sect you're from.

34:15.160 --> 34:16.580
If you miss the teleport window tomorrow,

34:16.950 --> 34:18.210
you're stuck here for another sixty years!

34:34.950 --> 34:36.490
This beast's scales are tough as nails.

34:36.880 --> 34:38.490
Regular spells do nothing to it.

34:38.640 --> 34:39.340
At my command!

34:48.160 --> 34:49.100
Activate the array!

34:49.270 --> 34:49.930
Yes, Grandmaster!

35:18.750 --> 35:19.780
Impressive indeed!

35:24.800 --> 35:26.540
It doesn't seem that hard to handle.

35:26.950 --> 35:27.650
Grandmaster,

35:27.840 --> 35:29.140
what kind of demon beast is that?

35:30.400 --> 35:31.020
No...

35:31.880 --> 35:33.140
It's not a Blackscale Python.

35:33.750 --> 35:34.890
It can shed its skin and evolve

35:35.560 --> 35:36.250
into a Blackflood Drake!

35:43.080 --> 35:44.250
It's now Tier 2.

35:45.190 --> 35:46.060
A Tier 2 demon beast?

35:47.000 --> 35:48.290
That's about the Mid Foundation Establishment Stage!

35:49.120 --> 35:50.250
Should I abandon the Celestial Essence Fruit?

35:51.190 --> 35:52.100
No need to panic.

35:53.600 --> 35:54.330
Form up!

36:30.080 --> 36:30.620
Retreat!

36:30.870 --> 36:32.020
You're no match for it!

36:58.350 --> 36:58.940
Grandmaster!

36:59.040 --> 37:00.100
The path is blocked!

37:02.640 --> 37:03.500
We're sealed in!

37:04.120 --> 37:05.420
There's no way out now!

37:21.040 --> 37:21.940
You wretched beast!

37:38.870 --> 37:39.810
Only one left?

37:40.310 --> 37:41.250
Can she take it alone?

37:51.520 --> 37:52.250
If you don't come out now,

37:52.520 --> 37:53.540
you're not getting out at all!

37:53.870 --> 37:55.060
Step outside and I'll die.

37:55.600 --> 37:56.850
Stay hidden and you'll still die!

38:16.750 --> 38:17.460
What are you waiting for?

38:29.750 --> 38:30.170
Run!

39:11.830 --> 39:12.810
You're pretty slick,

39:13.230 --> 39:14.730
hiding all this time and not making a move?

39:16.390 --> 39:17.420
I was afraid you'd kill me for my treasure.

39:18.520 --> 39:19.420
You're so young,

39:19.600 --> 39:20.500
but already this scheming?

39:21.080 --> 39:22.370
Not afraid you'll end up friendless?

39:23.390 --> 39:24.580
If I weren't this scheming,

39:25.080 --> 39:26.370
I'd be dead ten times over by now.

39:27.000 --> 39:27.980
There wouldn't be a later.

40:02.350 --> 40:03.370
I'm low on spiritual power.

40:03.670 --> 40:05.060
This won't hold it much longer.

40:05.440 --> 40:07.170
If you've got something, use it now!

40:09.670 --> 40:10.460
I do have

40:11.040 --> 40:11.850
one more talisman treasure.

40:12.160 --> 40:12.900
Then what are you waiting for?

40:12.960 --> 40:13.620
Hurry!

40:23.640 --> 40:24.290
Senior!

40:24.440 --> 40:25.730
I need time to activate it!

40:26.040 --> 40:26.810
You'll have to hold it off!

40:26.830 --> 40:27.620
I'll do my best,

40:27.830 --> 40:28.900
but you'll have to draw it away first!

40:42.600 --> 40:43.900
You ready yet?

40:44.040 --> 40:45.770
Do I look ready to you?

40:46.080 --> 40:47.140
Why don't you take over?

40:47.830 --> 40:50.170
Now you know how it feels to be left hanging?

41:36.560 --> 41:37.420
Move it!

41:38.120 --> 41:39.690
This is the Golden Brick Talisman,

41:39.920 --> 41:41.980
my shop's finest treasure!

41:42.480 --> 41:43.770
It's a bit slow

41:43.920 --> 41:45.500
to activate,

41:45.520 --> 41:46.650
but it's far

41:47.270 --> 41:47.690
from ordinary.

41:48.080 --> 41:48.730
Senior!

41:49.120 --> 41:50.020
Bear with me!

41:50.120 --> 41:51.540
This is all I've got left!

41:52.000 --> 41:52.850
Faster!

42:00.390 --> 42:01.140
You monster!

42:01.350 --> 42:02.250
Get down!

42:05.480 --> 42:06.500
It's insanely strong!

42:06.750 --> 42:07.810
I can't hold on much longer!

42:08.040 --> 42:08.730
Hurry!

42:08.920 --> 42:10.330
I'm going as fast as I can!

42:10.640 --> 42:11.540
Faster!

42:15.310 --> 42:16.250
Faster!

42:21.640 --> 42:22.210
Go!

43:16.340 --> 43:21.660
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

43:22.900 --> 43:28.300
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

43:28.420 --> 43:31.620
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

43:31.860 --> 43:34.100
♪Old scenes rise again♪

43:34.500 --> 43:37.340
♪Too hard to forget♪

43:37.860 --> 43:41.820
♪Easier just to miss♪

43:42.660 --> 43:48.140
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

43:49.300 --> 43:54.580
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

43:55.180 --> 43:58.220
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

43:58.500 --> 44:00.620
♪Swept away by time♪

44:01.260 --> 44:03.900
♪Eyes once looked far♪

44:04.380 --> 44:08.340
♪Now lost in the shift♪

44:08.820 --> 44:11.660
♪Autumn winds stir♪

44:11.940 --> 44:13.860
♪Smoke curls once more♪

44:14.300 --> 44:16.740
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

44:17.060 --> 44:20.580
♪Returning to my eyes♪

44:21.140 --> 44:24.100
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

44:24.420 --> 44:27.340
♪Time lost its name♪

44:27.740 --> 44:30.580
♪Was it yesterday♪

44:30.980 --> 44:34.540
♪Or tomorrow?♪

44:34.900 --> 44:37.740
♪The world has changed♪

44:38.140 --> 44:39.980
♪Beyond recall♪

44:40.540 --> 44:42.260
♪Time will fade♪

44:42.660 --> 44:47.460
♪All the words ever spoken♪

44:48.140 --> 44:51.020
♪Only this longing remains♪

44:51.500 --> 44:56.780
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

44:57.900 --> 45:04.540
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

45:05.020 --> 45:14.740
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
